/.idea

# Nothing here but the pages. molor/data/ and molor/tools/ once held the
# Fraterworks catalogue snapshot and its scrapers -- inputs to a tool in the
# LIBRARY repo, which reached across into this checkout for them, after which a
# `git add -A` swept 9 MB into a published commit (310fcb6, removed in 89f2e4d).
# They now live in olfactory-embeddings (vendor/fraterworks/, scripts/) and are
# gone from here. These rules stay as a tripwire: if anything recreates those
# paths, this repository is being used as somebody's working directory again.
molor/data/
molor/tools/
